WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.932 --> 00:00:05.153
Chuck Dave: Oooh.

2
00:00:05.273 --> 00:00:17.320
We're so scared!

3
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:20.381
Brad: You should be.

4
00:00:20.401 --> 00:00:23.103
Tina: I don't think they are serious.

5
00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:24.864
Brad: Well, they should be.

6
00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:33.040
Tina: Brad!

7
00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:33.900
Brad, let's go find Danny.

8
00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:37.322
Dave: Yeah, buzz off, you little pests.

9
00:00:38.222 --> 00:00:40.623
Chuck: Or we'll squash you like bugs!

10
00:00:40.683 --> 00:00:45.685
Tina: What were you going to do, fight them?

11
00:00:45.705 --> 00:00:47.386
Brad: I don't know.

12
00:00:47.406 --> 00:00:48.906
I just got so angry.

13
00:00:48.926 --> 00:00:51.007
Tina: We need to find Danny.

14
00:00:51.648 --> 00:00:52.428
I think he is upset.

15
00:00:52.488 --> 00:00:55.649
Brad: There's only one place he could be.

16
00:00:55.669 --> 00:00:59.711
Brad: Danny!

17
00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:04.076
Tina: Danny, are you okay?

18
00:01:04.096 --> 00:01:06.798
Brad: Why do you have mud on your face?

19
00:01:06.818 --> 00:01:09.399
Danny: I tripped and fell.

20
00:01:14.821 --> 00:01:16.262
Danny, you look terrible.

21
00:01:16.282 --> 00:01:18.863
Danny: I'm angry.

22
00:01:19.623 --> 00:01:22.024
And I'm going to get revenge on those bullies!

23
00:01:22.044 --> 00:01:24.305
Tina: Danny, calm down.

24
00:01:24.325 --> 00:01:30.368
Danny: I'm tired of being pushed around!

25
00:01:31.184 --> 00:01:33.045
Tina: Revenge and anger are not good.

26
00:01:33.065 --> 00:01:35.746
Danny: Being beaten up isn't good either!

27
00:01:35.766 --> 00:01:38.207
Brad: He's got a point there.

28
00:01:38.227 --> 00:01:39.968
Tina: Brad!

29
00:01:40.008 --> 00:01:43.449
Brad: Well, I want to get back at those bullies too.

30
00:01:43.469 --> 00:01:46.590
Brad: Even though it wasn't my pants they pulled down.

31
00:01:46.610 --> 00:01:49.932
Danny: Don't remind me!

32
00:01:49.952 --> 00:01:53.413
Tina: Maybe we should try to talk to them.

33
00:01:53.433 --> 00:01:55.794
Danny: Talking won't do anything!

34
00:01:56.434 --> 00:01:57.815
They're evil like Tristay.

35
00:01:57.855 --> 00:02:00.636
Danny: Did we "talk" with Tristay?

36
00:02:01.228 --> 00:02:02.929
Tina: That was a different situation!

37
00:02:02.949 --> 00:02:07.592
Danny: If Hopian were here, he would stomp those bullies.

38
00:02:07.612 --> 00:02:09.213
Tina: No, he wouldn't.

39
00:02:09.233 --> 00:02:12.696
Tina: He told us that he tried to talk with Tristay.

40
00:02:12.776 --> 00:02:19.120
Remember? Danny: Chuck and Dave must be stopped, or else they will pick on us forever.

41
00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:22.923
Tina: Be careful, or one day you'll be just like them.

42
00:02:25.504 --> 00:02:29.027
Danny: I don't want to talk to them!

43
00:02:29.567 --> 00:02:30.648
I want to hurt them!

44
00:02:33.549 --> 00:02:38.893
Tina: Danny, you're becoming just like Tristay!

45
00:02:38.913 --> 00:02:40.354
Danny: Me?

46
00:02:40.715 --> 00:02:41.595
Like Tristay?

47
00:02:42.296 --> 00:02:43.357
I'm the good guy.

48
00:02:43.377 --> 00:02:46.920
Tina: Please, Danny, don't seek revenge.

49
00:02:49.122 --> 00:02:51.784
Danny: Tina, you're either with me or against me.

50
00:02:51.804 --> 00:02:53.565
Tina: Danny, don't say that.

51
00:02:53.605 --> 00:02:54.726
Danny: Brad?

52
00:02:54.746 --> 00:02:56.908
Brad: I'm with you.

53
00:02:57.608 --> 00:02:59.670
Those bullies must be stopped.

54
00:03:01.291 --> 00:03:01.712
Danny: Tina?

55
00:03:02.004 --> 00:03:02.746
Are you with us?

56
00:03:02.766 --> 00:03:03.988
Tina: No.

57
00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:08.538
You are my friends, but nothing can be gained from revenge.

58
00:03:08.558 --> 00:03:09.580
Danny: Fine.

59
00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:10.361
Then go.
